Data Notice
-----------
The data files in data/ contain derived outputs from the following sources,
each subject to their own terms:

- Electricity consumption: CKW open smart meter dataset (Dataset B).
  Published by Centralschweizerische Kraftwerke AG under their open data terms.
  https://www.ckw.ch/ueber-ckw/engagement/open-data.html

- Temperature forecasts: ECMWF IFS model via Open-Meteo (CC BY 4.0).
  https://open-meteo.com
  Zippenfenig, P. (2023). Open-Meteo. DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.7970649
